Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{9^6}=\blueD{x^3}\cdot\purpleD{9^3}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{x\cdot x\cdot x}_\text{3 times}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{9\cdot9\cdot9}_\text{3 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{9\cdot 9\cdot 9\cdot 9\cdot 9\cdot 9}_\text{6 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
